  "reason": "Existing evidence is nonexistent, so the first experiment should establish a baseline for multimodal models. This tests the impact of combining RNA and image data (multimodal) with singleprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, and concat fusion. It isolates the effect of multimodal integration and provides initial insights into whether combining modalities improves performance compared to single-modality approaches."
